      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Let me also check the `AnnotationTestUtil` base class to understand the helper methods.Let me find the `Bogus` class referenced in the test.Let me check what's in the working directory and the compile script.Now I have a full picture. The original test references `Bogus` but that class is `private` in `JsonIgnorePropertiesTest` — so the improved test needs to define its own annotated class. Let me write a more understandable version."
